# Atlas group manifest - consumed by tools/atlas_pack.
# One group per line:
#   group <name>  page <1024|2048|4096>  mips <N | -1 | 0>  gutter <px>
# Inputs = every image (.png .jpg .jpeg .bmp .gif .tga) under assets/src/<name>/,
# recursively, sorted by path. Sprite name = file stem (no extension).
# Output -> assets/atlas/<name with '/' -> '_'>.{<page>.dds, atlas, cache}.
# GPU format is engine-global (uncompressed R8G8B8A8_UNORM_SRGB in v1), not set here.

group ui page 1024 mips 2 gutter 4
